THIRD-PARTY DATA
----------------

This project reads data from several external services. That data is NOT
covered by this licence and is not redistributed with it. Anyone running this
software is responsible for their own compliance with each provider's terms.
As used here:

  nflverse / nflreadpy   Open data under a permissive licence. Attribution to
                         the nflverse project is required.

  Yahoo Fantasy Sports   Accessed through the documented API under Yahoo's
                         developer terms. Requires the user's own credentials
                         and their own approved application.

  Sleeper                Public API. Sleeper's terms contemplate
                         non-commercial use, and its projections are licensed
                         to Sleeper by a third party.

  ESPN                   An unauthenticated endpoint with no public developer
                         programme covering it.

  FantasyPros (ECR)      Obtained via a community mirror. ECR is FantasyPros'
                         own commercial product and they sell API access to it.

Personal, non-commercial use of this software against those sources is the
only use it is written for. Redistributing their data, or offering this as a
paid service, would require licences this project does not hold.
